#firebase
firebase.js
# Exception: src/firebase.js IS committed on purpose. It contains only the
# Firebase *web* config, which is a public project identifier (not a secret) —
# access is controlled by Firebase Security Rules + Authorized Domains, and the
# app already ships these values to every visitor's browser. Every field can
# still be overridden per-environment via REACT_APP_FIREBASE_* build vars.
# Without committing it, the CI/clean-checkout build fails: "Can't resolve
# './firebase'". See CHANGELOG [1.20.9].
!src/firebase.js
serviceAccountKey.json

